{"id":"726997f4e47618d5","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-ideal-base.md","title":"Ideal Base","display":"df-ideal-base — Ideal Base","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ideal-base","aliases":["58-df-ideal-base"],"display":"df-ideal-base — Ideal Base","depends_on":["[[58-df-J]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ideal-base"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ideal-base</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ideal-base — Ideal Base"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8763ccf377783f45\" href=\"?note=8763ccf377783f45\" title=\"58-df-J\">58-df-J</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,X)\\)</span>（集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的理想，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8763ccf377783f45\" href=\"?note=8763ccf377783f45\" title=\"58-df-J\">58-df-J</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq I\">\\(B\\subseteq I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealBase}_S(B,I,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealBase}_S(B,I,X)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealBase}_S(B,I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,X)\\land B\\subseteq I\\land\\forall A\\in I\\;\\exists B_0\\in B\\;(A\\subseteq B_0)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealBase}_S(B,I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,X)\\land B\\subseteq I\\land\\forall A\\in I\\;\\exists B_0\\in B\\;(A\\subseteq B_0)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An ideal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> is tall if every infinite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X \\subseteq \\omega\">\\(X \\subseteq \\omega\\)</span> contains an infinite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y \\in I\">\\(Y \\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The nonstationary ideal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NS}_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{NS}_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-complete.</li>\n<li>Maximal ideals (ultrafilters) are dual to prime ideals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-J","status":"resolved","id":"8763ccf377783f45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-J]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-J","status":"resolved","id":"8763ccf377783f45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,X)$（集合 $X$ 上的理想，see [[58-df-J]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IdealBase}_S(B,I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealBase}_S(B,I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,X)\\land B\\subseteq I\\land\\forall A\\in I\\;\\exists B_0\\in B\\;(A\\subseteq B_0)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X \\subseteq \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"Y \\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NS}_{\\omega_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":867,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-654","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-ideal-base.md|58-df-ideal-base]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["8763ccf377783f45"]}